ent-OmuRPObjectiveVandalizeATS = Vandalize the Automated Trading Station
  .desc = You are tasked with creating a diversion by vandalizing the ATS. We don't care how you do it as long as the ATS is unusable once you are done.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveBeStealthy = Be Stealthy
  .desc = Your handler has been doing budget cuts and won't pay for the cost of a cover-up. Make sure your objectives are completed as quietly as possible, or at least keep your presence unknown!

ent-OmuRPObjectiveBecomeCaptain = Become Captain
  .desc = Become the new Captain of this station. It's time we take over!

ent-OmuRPObjectiveClimbCorporateLadder = Climb the Ladder
  .desc = Become the new head of your department. To ensure that no records are flagged, the previous head of staff must be demoted.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveSabotageComms = Sabotage a Communications Frequency
  .desc = We want you to take down as many radio channels as possible, for a minimum combined duration of six minutes. Whack the telecommunications server until it stops working, eject the key, we don't care how you do it. Just make sure theres some downtime.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveCyberneticSmuggling = Cybernetic Smuggling
  .desc = One of our best operatives has been caught and permanently incarcerated recently. Gather tools and join their ranks for an eventual breakout: Use station resources to install a cybernetic arm toolkit and get yourself taken to Central Command as a prisoner. Take care not to get yourself executed.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveDestroyTheTEG = Destroy the Thermo-Electric Generator
  .desc = Nanotrasen has been flooding the energy credit market through Power Transmission Lasers. We want you to stop this at the source.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveKillXenobio = Clean Up Xenobiology
  .desc = Kill all slimes in Xenobiology and dispose of the corpses to slow down scientific research. You're basically doing them a favor.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveShowOff = Impress Your Handler
  .desc = Your handler noticed we haven't been showing off enough. Make sure your objectives are completed in the most creative way possible. No, this doesn't mean killing everyone.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveEmptyArmory = Empty Security's Armory
  .desc = Make sure that all weaponry available to Security is no longer availible. You are free to do with the weapons as you please. Death to Nanotrasen!

ent-OmuRPObjectiveFifthColumn = Fifth Column
  .desc = Sabotage telecommunications, sow unrest and disinformation, undermine authority, facilitate infiltration by foreign agencies and don't get caught. Operate in complete secrecy, have an alibi and don't be obvious, adopt a new alias when undercover; you're nobody and anybody. Ensure you are not captured alive.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveCommitFraud = Commit Fraud
  .desc = We want you to prove that Nanotrasen's internal security is terrible. Commit fraud and get away with it. You could promise to do something in exchange for a valuable item and then run off while keeping your payment, get yourself promoted or recognized by taking credit for the work of others, pass off as someone you are not to get access to or steal something, or secretly embezzle resources while going unnoticed. The choice is yours, but the more it will embarrass Nanotrasen when revealed, the better. Make sure to write a report we can use to write an embarassing news article.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveHostageSituation = Take a Hostage
  .desc = Workers at Nanotrasen believe they are safe. Correct this misconception. Take a crew member hostage and hold them for at least twenty minutes. Choosing Command staff for your hostage is encouraged, but not required. This is a message, not an assassination. Avoid killing unless the situation collapses.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveStealIdentities = Steal Identities
  .desc = A high-paying client requests a copy of the ID card of every member of Command on the station. Through whichever means necessary, steal the ID card of every member of Command on the station, and get their ID cards onto the evacuation shuttle. The rest is up to you.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveCauseARiot = Cause a Riot
  .desc = Sow discord between Security on the station and crew by causing some sort of disturbance that needs putting down. A riot, protest, anything that makes Security take their riot gear out of the armory will do.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveIncompMajor = Fake It 'till You Make It
  .desc = We managed to infiltrate you on the station with this job, we know you aren't qualified and that's the point. Be incompetent, a minor inconvenience to your coworkers and crewmates, without getting fired.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveAiLawChange = Change the AI's Laws
  .desc = Command on your station has been boasting about their Station AI being untouchable. Show them that we can modify it whenever we want to. Change the Station AI's laws with any law board atleast once.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveRemoveSteel = No Steel for You
  .desc = You must deplete the station of as much steel as possible. Remove the walls if need be.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveMinimizeFootwear = NoBoot Camp
  .desc = Minimize the amount of footwear on-station. Make sure there are less than ten pairs of boots available.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveNothingPersonal = Nothing Personal
  .desc = Eliminate some crewmember and leave a business card by their body.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePowerOutage = Cause a Power Outage
  .desc = Cause a multi-departmental power outage that lasts at least 10 minutes. The longer, the better.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePowerSinkDetonation = Power Sink Detonation
  .desc = Due to recent reports about power sink malfunctions, we need you to perform a field test of a power sink from our current batch.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveSyndicatePresence = Make the Syndicate's Presence Known
  .desc = The crew were lied to about our lack of presence in this sector. Let the crew know of our presence. Try to do it peacefully, ideally through propaganda and vandalism.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveSpreadPropaganda = Down with Nanotrasen!
  .desc = Produce and distribute anti-Nanotrasen propaganda in the form of leaflets, syndicate merchandise, and leaked secrets. Remember that emagging vending machines can give you free syndicate merch!

ent-OmuRPObjectiveHijackTheRadio = Hijack the Radio
  .desc = We've got a whole box of Syndicate ads going unplayed, so it's up to you to make them useful. Ensure that Syndicate-branded radio disks are played at least three times this shift, to make it really sink in.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveRemoveMaints = Remove Maintenance
  .desc = Get rid of those maintenance shafts. Those engineers, slackers and bogeymen would be better off terrorizing departments instead of roaming in the darkness all shift.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveReplaceTheAI = Replace the AI
  .desc = We want literally anything else to be the Station AI for your shift. You will need two intellicards, one to download the current Station AI, and the other to install a new intelligence. Remember that you can use an intellicard to download positronic brains or personal AIs!

ent-OmuRPObjectiveNoWeldingFuel = Run on Fumes
  .desc = Deplete welding fuel reserves across the station. Either by breaking windows a smidge, or by stealing and hoarding welding fuel stockpiles.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveDestroyTheSalvageShuttle = Destroy the Salvage Shuttle
  .desc = We're getting tired of wandering salvagers discovering our infiltration ships, listening posts and other spaceborne installations. Stop this.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveDestroyTheCargoShuttle = Destroy the Cargo Shuttle
  .desc = Nanotrasen shuttlecraft is getting too robust. Send their shipping fleet a message.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveShrinkTheStation = Shrink the Station
  .desc = Make sure the station is smaller at the end of the shift then it is at the beginning.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveStealCargoSilo = Steal Cargo Silo
  .desc = The material silo Cargo has is of high interest to the Syndicate. Get the silo.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveUnsafeBar = Unsafe Bars
  .desc = Nanotrasen's bars are a safe space and their drinks are trusted. Ensure that most drinks consumed at the bar are spiked with psychedelics or poisons.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveUnsafeKitchen = Unsafe Kitchens
  .desc = Nanotrasen's kitchens are a safe space and their food is trusted. Ensure that most food consumed at the kitchen is spiked with psychedelics or poisons.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveAllThePetsAreMineNow = All the Pets Must Be Mine
  .desc = The Syndicate requires a bargaining chip of minor value. All of the station pets should suffice; steal and collect them all.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveStealAVehicle = Joy Rider
  .desc = Nothing is cooler than driving a stolen vehicle! Make it to the evacuation shuttle while driving a vehicle.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveSueNanotrasen = Sue Nanotrasen
  .desc = In the wake of the Space Court overturning Spess v. Weh, corporations are once again liable for damages caused on their stations. Capitalize on this opportunity by orchestrating or fabricating a situation in which Nanotrasen or one of its departments owes you money. This could be an excessive force case against Security, an insurance fraud scheme against Cargo, or anything else your evil little legal mind can dream up. The more time, money, and crew braincells expended, the better.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePromoteToRD = Get promoted to Acting Research Director
  .desc = The Syndicate wants to prepare an undercover agent for obtaining valuable research secrets in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Research Director by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePromoteToQM = Get promoted to Acting Quartermaster
  .desc = The Syndicate wants to prepare an undercover agent for embezzlement in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Quartermaster by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePromoteToCE = Get promoted to Acting Chief Engineer
  .desc = The Syndicate wants to prepare an undercover agent for stealing station blueprints in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Chief Engineer by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePromoteToCMO = Get promoted to Acting Chief Medical Officer
  .desc = The Syndicate wants to prepare an undercover agent for discreetly poisoning targets in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Chief Medical Officer by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePromoteToHOP = Get promoted to Acting Head of Personnel
  .desc = The Syndicate wants to prepare an undercover agent for getting our agents the right access and jobs in a later shift. Get yourself promoted to Head of Personnel by any means necessary and provide us the perfect disguise.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveVoxStation = Vox Station
  .desc = Vox have had to breathe out of a tank for too long, now it's everyone else's turn. Set distro to only use nitrogen.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveTeachRealLesson = Teach <target> a Lesson
  .desc = <target> has made one too many mistakes. It's about time we taught them a lesson they won't forget. Teach them ten fun facts on a space station–related topic of your choice.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePermaThisGuy = Get <target> Into Perma
  .desc = Make sure <target> is permanently incarcerated. We don't care how you do it. Them showing up at CentComm in cuffs without being a permanent prisoner isn't a job done, but it's better than nothing.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveBorgThisGuy = Turn <target> Into a Cyborg
  .desc = <target> has said some things to a High Command's personal cyborg they shouldn't have. Show them what it's like by having them turned into a cyborg themself.
